{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id32520925"}, "name":{"label":"SSB+"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-06-10T22:37:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"1640547715"}, "title":{"label":"Really nice update, worth the price"}, "content":{"label":"Those looking for a simple, effective productivity tool Things3 is one that's elegant, modern, simple, quick to input, and definitely worth checking out!\n\nSo many todo and GTD productivity tools out there, and I probably spent more time trying out apps, and trying to implement a GTD methodology to it, than actually just being productive and collect the info, and put it down.\n\nThings 3 has a clean interface that is simple and intuitive to use.\n\nFollows basic GTD principles without overwhelming or overcomplicating things for you.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id240464357"}, "name":{"label":"Brandon LaRocque"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-06-10T16:38:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"1640213088"}, "title":{"label":"Perfect for what I need"}, "content":{"label":"I used OmniFocus for a long time. This changed that.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id409239169"}, "name":{"label":"Jantics"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-06-09T11:26:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"1638905565"}, "title":{"label":"Beautifully designed and extremely functional"}, "content":{"label":"The app just works and it does so wonderfully. From small things like the movable \"+\" button to add items in a certain position within a list to the integration of calendar events within the upcoming list, Things 3 stands out extraordinarily from the rest. It's completely native and fluid unlike other apps like Todoist.\n\nOne small bug though: when adding to-do items to a sublist (by pressing the enter button on a soft keyboard), two empty sublist items are created occasionally.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id35920175"}, "name":{"label":"Doner_Morferelli"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-06-09T08:46:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"1638803350"}, "title":{"label":"Good app, overpriced"}, "content":{"label":"Works as advertised - you can make to do lists and the UI is designed well. \nBut man is the price a little steep for a glorified list maker. And on macOS it's an obscene $70. Yikes.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id35948928"}, "name":{"label":"neocitron"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-06-08T19:38:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"1638079361"}, "title":{"label":"Addictive!"}, "content":{"label":"I feel like I'm a more productive person, but ok not sure I actually am! Who cares!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id391847410"}, "name":{"label":"finnlyu"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-06-07T10:54:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"1636665510"}, "title":{"label":"Bug Report"}, "content":{"label":"Hi there,\n\nI've been using Things 3 for a few days and it's become my favourite way to start and finish a day. Calendar gets messy but Things 3 doesn't. I genuinely believe this is gonna be a part of iOS feature some point in time.\n\nThe bug I'm experiencing is that when you create a checklist inside a to-do item, hitting \"return\" to create another line actually creates two or more lines in the checklist. It's not a crucial bug but it's annoying. It's been here since 3.0.0 and also on 3.0.3. Please consider fixing it, thank you.\n\nBest,\nFinn", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id11504340"}, "name":{"label":"SpecialKen"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-06-06T22:25:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"1636064793"}, "title":{"label":"Great to do app"}, "content":{"label":"I've been using Things since the beginning, this is a clever next level. Quick, intuitive, and features I've wanted but didn't even know to ask for. Easily worth it for the time it saves me.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id24134642"}, "name":{"label":"GeoEng51"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-06-05T20:53:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1634969890"}, "title":{"label":"Wonderful Update"}, "content":{"label":"A friend told me about Things a few years ago and it became my go to app for tracking tasks in a very busy life of work, family and church commitments. I have since retired, but continue to use Things, as it seems life hasn't slowed down much. This update is elegant and welcome - worth the cost!! Thanks so much to the developers for continuing to improve their product.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id203191248"}, "name":{"label":"RaseshS"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-06-05T17:40:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1634797114"}, "title":{"label":"Fluid, Beautiful and Productive"}, "content":{"label":"Amazing animations, very fluid and just a wonderful experience. A little bit of a learning curve from someone coming from wunderlist simply because the app is laid out slightly different. Best $10.99 I've spent on the App Store", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
