{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id86493145"}, "name":{"label":"Tomek8268391037"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-27T11:31:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1625994064"}, "title":{"label":"Not satisfied"}, "content":{"label":"Apps should have new perk and things added in updates, not just come out with a new version. This in my opinion is very greedy. Basically we're getting milked, for an app that we \"barely notice\" and it's just \"you and your to-do list\". I'm not very impressed. If i see a Things 4, which i wouldn't be surprised, I won't be continuing to support. These features should have been all added to Things 2.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
